Client Home View
*Updated 2026-10-12 to match the Harbor design (design/harbor/client/static/home.html and home-pending.html). The design is the source of truth.*

Shows their lesson(s) for that day.
*Design additions:*
  A greeting with today's date, and a "Book a lesson" button.
  Today: each lesson today with its time, skater, length and price. With none: "No lessons today" and when the next one is.
  Coming up: the next 4 lessons, with a link to all bookings.
  A banner when a skater is still waiting for the coach's approval: you can book for them once they're approved.
    *More than one coach (2026-10-13, ADR-025 i):* one banner per waiting coach, naming the coach and the skaters.
  Your coach: the coach's name and initials, and only the contact details the coach has switched on (phone, email,
    each payment type the coach has switched on, ADR-016 d7). With none switched on: "Reply to any lesson email to reach Coach <name>."
    *More than one coach (2026-10-13, ADR-025 j):* "Your coaches", one card per coach with their sport and skaters.
    A coach who hasn't approved any of the family's skaters shows "Waiting" and no contact details.
  Lessons show which coach they're with when the family has more than one coach.
  If past lessons aren't marked paid yet, a line under the buttons gives how many and the total. *Phase 2 (ADR-003, 2026-10-12): unpaid history is coach-only in MVP.*

Button that routes to Monthly Client Booking View ("Book a lesson")
Button that routes to My bookings (see C_Client My Bookings.md)
Button that routes to Profile view
Button that routes to Payment view (phase 2), tagged "Phase 2"

The main navigation is Home · Book a lesson · My bookings · Profile.

Waiting for approval (no coach has approved any skater yet, ADR-022 d6; ADR-025 i):
  *2026-10-13:* a family approved by one coach and waiting for another sees the full site, not this page.
  Every message names the coach or coaches being waited for. With more than one, the waiting card lists each coach
    and which skaters they're approving, and each skater shows a "Waiting for Coach <name>" tag per coach
    (home-pending-two-coaches.html).
  The family sees only Home and Profile: no schedule, open times or coach contact details.
  Home says they're waiting for the coach to approve, and that the coach checks they know each family who signs up.
  Lists their skaters as waiting, with a link to edit or remove them.
  "What happens next": the coach approves each skater, the family is emailed, then booking opens.
  Signed up by mistake or with the wrong coach? Remove the skaters from the profile.
